  "title": "AI-driven organizational transformation: Why people still matter more than technology",
  "summary": "Organizational transformation isn't just about technology—it's about people. According to JLL's 2025 Global Real Estate Technology Survey, while 92% of companies are now piloting AI in corporate real estate, only 5% have achieved most of their objectives. Carolyn Trickett, Growth Principal, dives into the fundamentals as well as the impact and expectation of AI’s revolution of CRE in our latest blog post.",
